[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0508","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-14644","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server IIOP T3反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"` tags embedded in it. Let me look at the raw description:\n\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\ntags.\n\nActually, I need to think about what the user is asking. They want me to process this CVE according to the AVE skill. Let me generate the complete TOML output.\n\nFor the PoC, let me use a more realistic T3 handshake. The T3 protocol starts with \"t3\" followed by version info, then headers.\n\nLet me write the complete output now.Now I have enough information to write a comprehensive Chinese description for CVE-2020-14644. Let me craft a detailed description covering the vulnerability principle, impact, attack conditions, and exploitation method.\n\nThe vulnerability is in Oracle WebLogic Server's Core component, affecting versions 12.2.1.3.0, 12.2.1.4.0, and 14.1.1.0.0. It's an insecure deserialization vulnerability via IIOP/T3 protocols that allows unauthenticated remote attackers to achieve RCE. The CVSS score is 9.8 (CRITICAL).\n\nThe exploitation involves using RemoteConstructor with ClassDefinition to load a malicious class via defineClass, bypassing authentication. The attack requires network access to the WebLogic T3/IIOP ports (typically 7001).<value>Oracle WebLogic Server Core 组件存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 IIOP 或 T3 协议向目标 WebLogic 服务器发送特制的序列化数据包，利用 RemoteConstructor 与 ClassDefinition 机制触发 defineClass 加载恶意类并实例化，从而实现无需任何认证的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0 及 14.1.1.0.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者成功利用后可完全接管服务器，导致数据泄露、服务中断甚至内网横向移动。Oracle 已在 2020 年 7 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。\"\"\"\n```\n\nSo the description field is a mess - it has English text, internal monologue, and the actual Chinese description mixed in with `<value>` tags. The TOML parser would see this as one big string with all that junk in it. The error says \"description 字段为空\" which might mean the parser couldn't properly extract it, or the content is considered invalid.\n\nI need to provide a clean, proper Chinese description. Let me write one that's ≥50 characters, covers all required aspects.\n\nThe actual Chinese description that was embedded in the middle is actually good. Let me extract and clean it up, making it even better.<value>Oracle WebLogic Server Core 组件存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 IIOP 或 T3 协议向目标 WebLogic 服务器发送特制的序列化数据包，利用 RemoteConstructor 与 ClassDefinition 机制触发 defineClass 加载恶意类并实例化，从而实现无需任何认证的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0 及 14.1.1.0.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者成功利用后可完全接管服务器，导致数据泄露、服务中断甚至内网横向移动。Oracle 已在 2020 年 7 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。\n","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-14644"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-15T18:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle WebLogic Server 至 12.2.1.3.0 及以上版本的官方补丁（2020年7月 CPU），或升级至 12.2.1.4.0/14.1.1.0.0 并应用最新 Patch Set Update。如无法立即升级，可在 WebLogic 控制台禁用 T3 协议（将 `weblogic.security.SSL.enableT3` 设为 false），或通过防火墙限制对 7001 端口的 T3/IIOP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-14644","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14644.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-14644.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2020/CVE-2020-14644.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/javascript/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14644.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2020/14xxx/CVE-2020-14644.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2020/14xxx/CVE-2020-14644.json","https://github.com/gobysec/Weblogic/blob/6bc36ba93b5cf059f3aa84dac4aa3ae4f5ae45ab/Analysis_of_CVE-2020-14644_zh_CN.md","https://github.com/gobysec/Weblogic/blob/6bc36ba93b5cf059f3aa84dac4aa3ae4f5ae45ab/Analysis_of_CVE-2020-14644_en_US.md","https://github.com/DawnFlame/POChouse/blob/f5b80965c38eb4f42133f4f458650bae5cc75b98/Weblogic/[CVE-2020-14644]-远程命令执行/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-14644.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-14644.md","https://github.com/potats0/cve_2020_14644","https://github.com/cokeBeer/logi","https://github.com/0xkami/cve-2020-14644"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0406","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1350","title":"Microsoft Windows DNS 服务器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows DNS 服务器存在严重远程代码执行漏洞（代号 SigRed），由于 DNS 服务在处理特制 DNS 查询请求时存在整数溢出缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标 DNS 服务器发送恶意构造的 DNS 响应包触发堆溢出，从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows Server 2008 至 2019 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，且已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。Microsoft 已于 2020 年 7 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议立即安装补丁或启用注册表缓解措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1350"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-14T23:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:01:10Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 7 月安全更新（KB4569509 或后续累积更新），该补丁已修复 Windows DNS Server 在处理请求时的远程代码执行漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可设置注册表缓解措施：在 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\DNS\\Parameters 下新建 DWORD 值 TcpReceivePacketSize，数据设为 0xFF00（十进制 65280），然后以管理员身份运行 `net stop dns && net start dns` 重启 DNS 服务。该缓解措施限制入站 TCP DNS 响应包最大为 65280 字节，可阻断利用超大响应包触发的堆溢出攻击。补丁安装后应移除该注册表修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158484/SIGRed-Windows-DNS-Denial-Of-Service.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1350","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1350","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-1350.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2020-1350/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2020-1350/README_EN.md","https://github.com/psc4re/NSE-scripts/blob/b9aa5cdc49d353707fecbf2bc42215b5c337c24c/cve-2020-1350.nse","https://github.com/cckuailong/vulbase/blob/153d4a90a23af10f17ca0a65fb50f12b2f91edfc/edge/Edge_Security/DNS Server远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2020-1350).md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【文库】edge狼组/Edge_Security/DNS Server远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2020-1350).md","https://github.com/tobor88/PowerShell-Blue-Team/blob/e76a479e620a604fd49ae9f3e9d6291b4bce3079/Find-CVE-2020-1350.ps1","https://github.com/PaoloFrigo/scriptinglibrary/blob/1c584b5339ef6547debc2755d479969376fe0a57/Blog/PowerShell/Workaround-CVE-2020-1350.ps1","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[翻译]CVE-2020-1350 SigRedDNS 漏洞分析.md","https://github.com/tenable/audit_files/blob/8694c356af5885f65455bc31a960abd8e44468b8/cve-2020-1350/cve-2020-1350.audit","https://github.com/ZephrFish/CVE-2020-1350_HoneyPoC","https://github.com/maxpl0it/CVE-2020-1350-DoS","https://github.com/psc4re/NSE-scripts","https://github.com/tinkersec/cve-2020-1350","https://github.com/captainGeech42/CVE-2020-1350"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0168","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1040","title":"Microsoft Hyper-V RemoteFX vGPU 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Hyper-V RemoteFX vGPU 功能存在输入验证不当漏洞，主机服务器未能正确验证来自客户机操作系统中已认证用户的输入数据，导致远程代码执行。攻击者需拥有客户机操作系统的合法登录权限，通过构造特制的输入触发漏洞，可在 Hyper-V 宿主机上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响启用了 RemoteFX vGPU 功能的 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 9.0，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 7 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1040"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-14T23:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:00:17Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 7 月安全更新（对应 KB4565511 等补丁），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可在 Hyper-V 主机上禁用 RemoteFX vGPU 功能：在 PowerShell 中执行 `Set-VMRemoteFXPhysicalVideoAdapter -Disable`，或从虚拟机设置中移除 RemoteFX 3D 适配器。NVIDIA 用户还应参考 NVIDIA 安全公告 5044 更新 GPU 驱动。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议优先修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5044","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1040","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1040","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1040.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1041.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1043.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1042.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1032.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1036.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-1040.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10403.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10400.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10407.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1689","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-6287","title":"SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 的 LM Configuration Wizard 组件存在身份认证缺失漏洞，未对配置任务执行请求进行身份验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求，直接执行配置任务并创建管理员账户，从而完全接管 SAP Java 系统，导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性遭到严重破坏。该漏洞影响 SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 7.30、7.31、7.40 及 7.50 版本，攻击者可利用此漏洞在无需事先认证的情况下获得系统管理员权限，进而执行任意操作。CVSS v3.1 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-6287"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-14T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:23:00Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP Note 2934135 发布的官方安全补丁，将 LM Configuration Wizard 升级到以下补丁级别或更高版本：7.30 SP020 Patch 0001、7.31 SP026 Patch 0001、7.40 SP021 Patch 0001、7.50 SP018 Patch 0001。补丁可从 SAP 支持门户下载并手动安装，安装后重启 SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 服务使修复生效。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制对 /CTCWebService/ 端点的访问，或使用防火墙拦截外部对该端口的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162085/SAP-JAVA-Configuration-Task-Execution.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2021/Apr/6","https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2934135","https://wiki.scn.sap.com/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=552599675","https://www.onapsis.com/recon-sap-cyber-security-vulnerability","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-6287","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-6287.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-6287.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-6287-5218.yaml","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/sap/poc_sap_cve-2020-6287_2020.py","https://github.com/DawnFlame/POChouse/blob/f5b80965c38eb4f42133f4f458650bae5cc75b98/SAP/SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 任意用户添加/CVE-2020-6287.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2020/6xxx/CVE-2020-6287.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-6287/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-6287.py","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-6286.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/fb5f206c909d2a25672d2f7083207d9364c4215a/2020/CVE-2020-6287.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-6287.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-6287.md","https://github.com/chipik/SAP_RECON","https://github.com/duc-nt/CVE-2020-6287-exploit","https://github.com/Onapsis/CVE-2020-6287_RECON-scanner","https://github.com/murataydemir/CVE-2020-6287","https://github.com/dylvie/CVE-2020-6287_SAP-NetWeaver-bypass-auth"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1689.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0208","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1147","title":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":".NET Framework、SharePoint Server 和 Visual Studio 存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标 SharePoint 服务器发送特制请求，触发 .NET 反序列化机制中的不安全类型解析，从而在服务器上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SharePoint Server 2019、.NET Framework 4.x 及 Visual Studio 2019 等多个产品。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，已出现野外在野利用。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 6 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1147"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2020-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 7 月安全更新，通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取补丁。受影响版本包括：.NET Framework 4.6/4.7/4.8、.NET Core 2.1/3.1、SharePoint Server 2010/2013/2016/2019、Visual Studio 2017/2019。对于 SharePoint Server，升级至最新累积更新；对于 .NET Core，升级至 2.1.21 或 3.1.7 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，在 SharePoint 中禁用不受信任的 XML 文件上传功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50151","https://www.exploitalert.com/view-details.html?id=35992","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1147","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-1147.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-1147-4404.yaml","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/sharepoint/poc_sharepoint_rce_cve-2020-1147_2020.py","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-1147.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-11476.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-11474.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2020/1xxx/CVE-2020-1147.json","https://github.com/jaeles-project/jaeles-signatures/blob/98b358e9737131b01d5ab0685c063be52e3e3754/cves/ms-sharepoint-rce-cve-2020-1147.yaml","https://github.com/CharanRayudu/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/6418cf9ac43a7d4121d979ae9afb12f54511729e/CVE-2020-1147.yaml","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-1147.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0200","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-10987","title":"Tenda AC15 AC1900 命令注入漏洞","description":"Tenda AC15 AC1900 无线路由器固件版本 15.03.05.19 存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。该漏洞源于 goform/setUsbUnload 接口未对用户输入进行有效过滤，攻击者可通过 POST 请求中的 deviceName 参数注入并执行任意系统命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可被远程利用，CVSS 评分为 9.8，危害等级为严重。成功利用该漏洞可使攻击者完全控制受影响的路由器设备。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-10987"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-13T19:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:48:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级路由器固件到最新版本，如 AC15 设备请访问官方网站下载最新稳定版本固件并进行升级。如无法立即升级，可通过管理页面禁用 USB功能以关闭 setUsbUnload 接口作为临时缓解措施，并在防火墙上限制对路由器管理端口的访问，仅允许内部网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.securityevaluators.com/tenda-ac1900-vulnerabilities-discovered-and-exploited-e8e26aa0bc68","https://www.ise.io/research/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-10987","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-10987.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10987.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2020/CVE-2020-10987.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/IoT-vulhub/blob/80a58b00485403fd88578da85d846210cc9792f2/Tenda/CVE-2020-10987/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-10987.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-10987.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2020/CVE-2020-10987/README.md","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/b462c9cd0d28b2eeb23f29c6058d091a22f703a2/appsec-rules/crowdsecurity/vpatch-CVE-2020-10987.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-10987.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-10987.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/IoT-vulhub/blob/80a58b00485403fd88578da85d846210cc9792f2/vuln_list.md","https://github.com/Jaden-Bowers/Tenda-Router-VR-and-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1809","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8196","title":"Citrix ADC 与 Gateway 未授权访问信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Citrix ADC、Citrix Gateway 及 Citrix SDWAN WAN-OP 多个版本存在访问控制不当漏洞（CWE-284、CWE-287）。低权限用户可通过未授权访问 Citrix Nitro API 接口，绕过身份验证机制获取系统敏感信息，如网络拓扑、设备配置及用户会话等受限数据。该漏洞影响 Citrix ADC 和 Gateway 13.0-58.30 之前、12.1-57.18 之前、12.0-63.21 之前、11.1-64.14 之前及 10.5-70.18 之前版本，以及 Citrix SDWAN WAN-OP 11.1.1a 之前、11.0.3d 之前和 10.2.7 之前版本。攻击者无需用户交互即可在网络远程发起利用，但需具备低权限凭据，仅导致有限的信息泄露，无法修改数据或执行代码。CVSS v3.1 评分为 4.3，危害等级为中危。Citrix 已在后续版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至安全版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8196"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-10T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:02Z","remediation":"立即将 Citrix ADC 和 Citrix Gateway 升级至修复版本 13.0-58.30、12.1-57.18、12.0-63.21、11.1-64.14 或 10.5-70.18，将 Citrix SD-WAN WAN-OP 升级至 11.1.1a、11.0.3d 或 10.2.7。如暂无法升级，应通过防火墙或访问控制列表限制对 Nitro API 端口的未授权访问，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问，并监控异常 API 请求日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160047/Citrix-ADC-NetScaler-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX276688","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8196","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8196.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/51f8c96d50c8c7ae031edb7329c1da6bbd1f0b5d/2020/CVE-2020-8196.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-8196.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-8196.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-8196.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-8196.rules","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Citrix/（CVE-2020-8196）Citrix Nitro API 未授权访问漏洞.md","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-8196.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/Citrix/（CVE-2020-8196）Citrix Nitro API 未授权访问漏洞.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-8196.json","https://github.com/Zeop-CyberSec/citrix_adc_netscaler_lfi"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1809.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1809.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1808","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8195","title":"Citrix ADC Gateway SDWAN WAN-OP 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Citrix ADC 和 Citrix Gateway 等产品存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），低权限用户可通过发送特制请求绕过访问控制，访问未经授权的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Citrix ADC 13.0-58.30、12.1-57.18、12.0-63.21、11.1-64.14 及 10.5-70.18 之前版本，以及 Citrix SDWAN WAN-OP 11.1.1a、11.0.3d 及 10.2.7 之前版本。攻击者无需用户交互，在网络中即可利用此漏洞读取系统敏感配置信息。Citrix 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8195"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-10T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:01Z","remediation":"立即升级Citrix ADC和Citrix Gateway到13.1-50.70或更高版本，或12.1-65.18及以上版本，这些版本包含针对CVE-2020-8195的修复。如果无法立即升级，可临时禁用NITRO API接口或限制其仅对内网IP访问，作为即时的缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160047/Citrix-ADC-NetScaler-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX276688","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8195","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/0x783kb/Threat-Analysis-Handbook/blob/c35524f11e7cd0fdd97596792dc2883cedbfa69b/Web/2020/T1190-CVE-2020-8193-CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8195.json","https://github.com/satan1a/TheRoadOfSO/blob/a041e5eae58e510e2749156e9f4b100d4749cbcc/docs/0x2_ 威胁狩猎/2x3_初始访问/T1190-CVE-2020-8193-CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/51f8c96d50c8c7ae031edb7329c1da6bbd1f0b5d/2020/CVE-2020-8195.json","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Citrix/（CVE-2020-8195）Citrix 未授权访问漏洞.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/Citrix/（CVE-2020-8195）Citrix 未授权访问漏洞.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/satan1a/RedBook/blob/bc9d27c76b88759ab490460630132b8fdcd7c3fa/docs/0x3_初始访问/T1190-CVE-2020-8193-CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/Zeop-CyberSec/citrix_adc_netscaler_lfi"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1806","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8193","title":"Citrix ADC 及 Gateway 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Citrix ADC 和 Citrix Gateway 存在访问控制不当漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP 请求访问系统中特定 URL 端点，绕过正常身份验证流程获取敏感配置信息。该漏洞影响 Citrix ADC 和 Citrix Gateway 的多个版本（13.0-58.30 之前、12.1-57.18 之前、12.0-63.21 之前、11.1-64.14 之前及 10.5-70.18 之前版本），以及 Citrix SDWAN WAN-OP 的 11.1.1a 之前、11.0.3d 之前和 10.2.7 之前版本。攻击者无需任何凭据即可在低复杂度条件下远程利用此漏洞，成功利用可能导致系统敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 6.5。Citrix 官方已发布对应版本的安全更新修复此访问控制缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8193"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-10T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 Citrix ADC 和 Citrix Gateway 至 13.0-58.30、12.1-57.18、12.0-63.21、11.1-64.14 或 10.5-70.18 及更高版本，Citrix SDWAN WAN-OP 升级至 11.1.1a、11.0.3d 或 10.2.7 及更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 NetScaler IP (NSIP) 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问相关 URL 端点，并监控日志中未经授权的访问尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160047/Citrix-ADC-NetScaler-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX276688","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8193","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-8193.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8193.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2020-8193-5297.yaml","https://github.com/0x783kb/Threat-Analysis-Handbook/blob/c35524f11e7cd0fdd97596792dc2883cedbfa69b/Web/2020/T1190-CVE-2020-8193-CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-8193/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-8193.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-8193.py","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/citrix/poc_citrix-cve-2020-8193-unauthorized.py","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8196.md","https://github.com/satan1a/TheRoadOfSO/blob/a041e5eae58e510e2749156e9f4b100d4749cbcc/docs/0x2_ 威胁狩猎/2x3_初始访问/T1190-CVE-2020-8193-CVE-2020-8195.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/51f8c96d50c8c7ae031edb7329c1da6bbd1f0b5d/2020/CVE-2020-8193.json","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2020-8193","https://github.com/Airboi/Citrix-ADC-RCE-CVE-2020-8193","https://github.com/PR3R00T/CVE-2020-8193-Citrix-Scanner","https://github.com/Zeop-CyberSec/citrix_adc_netscaler_lfi","https://github.com/ctlyz123/CVE-2020-8193"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0686","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-15505","title":"MobileIron Core & Connector & Sentry 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MobileIron Core、Connector、Sentry 及 Monitor and Reporting Database (RDB) 产品中存在远程代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响组件的 LogService 发送特制请求，利用不安全的输入处理机制触发任意代码执行，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 MobileIron Core/Connector 10.6.0.0 及更早版本、Sentry 9.8.0 及更早版本、RDB 2.0.0.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需用户交互，利用复杂度低，可导致数据泄露、服务中断及内网横向移动。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-15505"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-07T02:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:56:45Z","remediation":"升级 MobileIron Core/Connector 至 v10.7.0.1 或更高版本，Sentry 升级至 v9.8.1 或更高版本，Monitor and Reporting Database (RDB) 升级至 v2.0.0.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在防火墙层面限制对 LogService 端口（默认 8443）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161097/MobileIron-MDM-Hessian-Based-Java-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/41.html","https://perchsecurity.com/perch-news/cve-spotlight-mobileiron-rce-cve-2020-15505/","https://www.mobileiron.com/en/blog/mobileiron-security-updates-available","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-15505","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-15505.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-15505.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2020-15505.yaml","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/fd1186f98372650d467d66100db6453e43d279be/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2020-15505.yara","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-15505.yaml","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2020-15505/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2020-15505_A_dha.yar","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-15505.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/MobileIron/（CVE-2020-15505）MobileIron 远程命令执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-15505.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-15505/poc/others/README.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/MobileIron/（CVE-2020-15505）MobileIron 远程命令执行漏洞.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0686.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0686.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1687","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-5902","title":"F5 BIG-IP TMUI 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"F5 BIG-IP 设备的 Traffic Management User Interface（TMUI，又称 Configuration utility）存在远程代码执行漏洞。由于未对用户输入进行严格校验，攻击者可通过构造恶意请求执行目录遍历操作，上传或读取敏感文件，进而获取系统权限并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BIG-IP 15.0.0-15.1.0.3、14.1.0-14.1.2.5、13.1.0-13.1.3.3、12.1.0-12.1.5.1 及 11.6.1-11.6.5.1 版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者仅需向目标设备的 TMUI 页面发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发漏洞，实现完全系统控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-5902"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-01T15:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:22:25Z","remediation":"标签中。<value>升级F5 BIG-IP到不受影响版本：15.x升级至15.1.0.4或更高，14.1.x升级至14.1.2.6，13.1.x升级至13.1.3.4，12.1.x升级至12.1.5.2，11.6.x升级至11.6.5.2。如暂无法升级，通过管理界面访问列表限制TMUI仅允许可信IP访问，或在防火墙上阻断外部对TMUI端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158333/BIG-IP-TMUI-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158334/BIG-IP-TMUI-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158366/F5-BIG-IP-TMUI-Directory-Traversal-File-Upload-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158414/Checker-CVE-2020-5902.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158581/F5-Big-IP-13.1.3-Build-0.0.6-Local-File-Inclusion.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/175671/F5-BIG-IP-TMUI-Directory-Traversal-File-Upload-Code-Execution.html","https://badpackets.net/over-3000-f5-big-ip-endpoints-vulnerable-to-cve-2020-5902/","https://github.com/Critical-Start/Team-Ares/tree/master/CVE-2020-5902","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K52145254","https://swarm.ptsecurity.com/rce-in-f5-big-ip/","https://www.criticalstart.com/f5-big-ip-remote-code-execution-exploit/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/290915","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-5902","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48643","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-5902.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5902.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/f5/cve-2020-5902.py","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2020/CVE-2020-5902.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/