未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CLP-team/Vigor-Commond-Injection","https://www.draytek.com/about/security-advisory","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-15415","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-15415.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-15415.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-15415.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2020/15xxx/CVE-2020-15415.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-15415/poc/pocsuite3/CVE-2020-15415.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2020/15xxx/CVE-2020-15415.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/draytek/vigor/CVE-2020-15415.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-15415.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-15415.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-15415.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-15415.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0609","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-15069","title":"Sophos XG Firewall 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sophos XG Firewall 17.x 至 v17.5 MR12 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源于 HTTP/S Bookmarks 功能在处理客户端无代理访问请求时未对输入数据大小进行正确检查。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行，从而完全控制目标防火墙设备。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响所有运行 v17.x 版本的 Sophos XG Firewall。Sophos 已发布热修复补丁 HF062020.1 修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-15069"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-06-29T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:59Z","remediation":"Sophos已发布热补丁HF062020.1，所有运行v17.x版本的XG Firewall应立即安装该热修复补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙管理界面配置访问控制策略，仅允许可信IP地址访问HTTPS 4444端口，并禁用不必要的HTTP/S Bookmarks无客户端访问功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.sophos.com/b/security-blog/posts/advisory-buffer-overflow-vulnerability-in-user-portal","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-15069","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-15069.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2020/15xxx/CVE-2020-15069.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2020/15xxx/CVE-2020-15069.json","https://github.com/sophoslabs/IoCs/blob/a325a15a33c39a166b0461ddad8e3cb7eb3ceab6/Pacific_Rim_CVE-2020-15069_IOCs.csv","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-15069.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-15069.json","https://github.com/vuldb/cyber_threat_intelligence/blob/3cc6c3731493c443609393af8ed5688154422e73/campaigns/c/CVE-2020-12271 and CVE-2020-15069/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-15069.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-15069.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-15069.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0909","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-2021","title":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS SAML 认证签名验证绕过漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS 的 SAML 认证功能存在签名验证不当漏洞（CWE-347）。当启用 SAML 认证且未勾选\"验证身份提供商证书\"选项时，PAN-OS 无法正确验证 SAML 断言中的数字签名，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可伪造 SAML 响应绕过认证，从而访问受保护的资源。该漏洞影响 PAN-OS 9.1.3 之前版本、9.0.9 之前版本、8.1.15 之前版本及 8.0 全版本（已停服）。在 GlobalProtect 网关/门户、Clientless VPN、Captive Portal 和 Prisma Access 场景下，攻击者可利用该漏洞绕过认证策略获取受保护资源访问权限；在 PAN-OS 和 Panorama Web 管理界面场景下，攻击者可登录为管理员并执行任意管理操作，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Palo Alto Networks 已在 PAN-OS 9.1.3、9.0.9、8.1.15 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-2021"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-06-29T15:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:11:38Z","remediation":"立即将 PAN-OS 升级至修复版本：8.1.15、9.0.9、9.1.3 或更高版本。升级前务必在 SAML Identity Provider Server Profile 中配置 Identity Provider Certificate（IdP 证书），并启用 \"Validate Identity Provider Certificate\" 选项。如 IdP 使用自签名证书无法启用该选项，需更换为 CA 签发的证书。临时缓解措施：禁用 SAML 认证改用其他认证方式，或在防火墙管理接口限制仅允许可信管理网络访问。PAN-OS 8.0 已 EOL，必须升级到受支持版本。升级后建议重启防火墙和 Panorama 以清除所有未授权会话，并通过 `show user ip-user-mapping all type SSO` 检查并清理 Captive Portal 中的异常用户会话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2020-2021","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-2021","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-2021.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2020/2xxx/CVE-2020-2021.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-2021.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-2021.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-20211.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-20218.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-20212.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-20217.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-20216.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-20215.md","https://github.com/1n7erface/PocList","https://github.com/psc4re/NSE-scripts","https://github.com/CENSUS/whatsapp-mitd-mitm","https://github.com/Sauercloud/RWCTF21-VirtualBox-61-escape","https://github.com/sh3d0ww01f/WaterDragon"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0306","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-11899","title":"Treck TCP/IP stack 输入验证错误漏洞","description":"Treck TCP/IP 协议栈在处理 IPv6 数据包时存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），由于对 IPv6 扩展头长度校验不充分，相邻网络中的未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 IPv6 数据包触发该漏洞，导致敏感内存信息泄露或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Treck TCP/IP 6.0.1.66 之前的所有版本，广泛应用于嵌入式系统和物联网设备中。Treck 公司已在 6.0.1.66 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2020-11899"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-06-17T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:51:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Treck TCP/IP stack 升级至 6.0.1.66 或更高版本。Cisco 用户升级 StarOS 至 21.5.27/21.11.15/21.20.2 等修复版本；Intel 用户安装 INTEL-SA-00295 对应补丁；Dell/NetApp/Aruba 用户参考各厂商安全公告安装更新。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络边界部署 ACL 过滤异常 IPv6 流量，并禁用不必要的 IPv6 隧道功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2020-006.txt","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/125.html","https://jsof-tech.com/vulnerability-disclosure-policy/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20200625-0006/","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-treck-ip-stack-JyBQ5GyC","https://www.dell.com/support/article/de-de/sln321836/dell-response-to-the-ripple20-vulnerabilities","https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/security-center/advisory/intel-sa-00295.html","https://www.jsof-tech.com/ripple20/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/257161","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/257161/","https://www.treck.com","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-11899","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-11899.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2020/11xxx/CVE-2020-11899.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-11899.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-11899.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-11899.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-11899.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/d85e3a1792768837470e0c79fd15b0f8bd851146/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-11899.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-11899.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-11899.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-11899.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0306.toml"}]